# Muzora currently talks to YT Music's public InnerTube API directly using
# the same public client keys SimpMusic ships in-app — nothing secret is
# required to run search/playback in this first iteration.
#
# Reserved for later iterations (accounts, Spotify import, AI features,
# lyrics providers) so there's a clear place to add them without hardcoding
# secrets into client-side code, per the "no secrets in client bundle" rule:
# SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
# SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=
# LYRICS_PROVIDER_API_KEY=
